  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "1322-root",
    "title": "AKU academic day: Taking Teaching and Learning to the next level",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "AKU Network of Teaching and Learning held an academic day convened by the President and Interim Provost for deans and directors of all AKU entities from Pakistan and East Africa in June",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "9a65a33e4a625491",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "1322-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/1322-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "AKU academic day: Taking Teaching and Learning to the next level"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKU Network of Teaching and Learning held an academic day convened by the President and Interim Provost for deans and directors of all AKU entities from Pakistan and East Africa in June. Over 17 deans and directors from different entities attended the meeting that was facilitated by the TL_net team. The main aim of the academic day was to identify ways to improve teaching and support for Learning at AKU. In her opening remarks Dr. Tashmin Khamis the Director of Teaching and Learning outlined five key objectives towards achieving the goal of the forum: "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Assess the evidence on the current status of teaching and learning across AKU"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Create a shared understanding of teaching excellence at AKU"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Consider strengths as well as gaps in creating an enabling student learning experience"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Identify and agree upon actions to improve teaching and learning"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Consider measurable outcomes and resources required to enhance teaching and learning for the budget planning cycle"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The deans and directors identified university wide teaching and learning priorities around four areas:"
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Academic/learning support for students"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Academic leadership support and curriculum development"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Teaching excellence"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Recognition and reward for teaching excellence and scholarship"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The academic leaders will further consult with their entities to ensure all the priorities have been covered and integrated into 2017 plans and budgets. The deans and directors expressed satisfaction that this was a very crucial forum that will put in place plans to improve teaching and learning at AKU. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Asked on what they thought about the forum, some deans and directors had this to say:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Superb interactive session across the university and dialogue to better define teaching and learning in our entities\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Very helpful session. I learnt from colleagues as well as know a bit more about the work of Teaching and Learning Network\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Asked on whether the academic day was helpful this is what one academic head said:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Yes, extremely helpful especially on areas covered and approach taken as well as getting to know more about what is going on across AKU\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On what they see as next steps, here are a few selected quotes from the evaluation:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"As suggested by the president, make this an annual event so as to continue the dialogue\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"TL_net help us to put our plans together\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Most critical part for me is to follow up on the strategies and action plans\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The forthcoming teaching and learning enhancement workshop for faculty in East Africa and Pakistan is one of the initial steps taken by TL_net to address the concerns raised at the Academic Day. The workshop which is modeled around the internationally recognized Instructional Skills Workshop (ISW) will be supported by Dr. Debra Dawson and Dr. Michael Atkinson from Western University, Ontario Canada and representatives of the ISW Network. The first cohort of East Africa participants will attend the workshop in July in Dar es Salaam while those from Pakistan will attend in September."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "TL_net will continue to support faculty in enhancing quality, teaching and learning."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
